    <p class="resume-profile">
      Industrial designer with 20+ years of product development experience specializing in additive manufacturing for protective equipment. Founder/co-founder of KUPOL, KOLLIDE/K3D, and nonplanar.xyz. Named inventor on multiple international patent families. Led development of 3D-printed helmet technology now ranked #1 by Virginia Tech and #2 in NFL position-specific testing.
    </p>
