      <li>Developed K3D liner technology achieving <strong>#1 Virginia Tech ratings</strong> (Varsity & Youth) and <strong>#2 NFL 2025 rankings</strong> (QB & OL)</li>
      <li>4 out of 11 five-star varsity helmets in Virginia Tech's 2025 ratings feature K3D technology</li>
      <li>Achieved 0.78 HPS in NFL testing (target: 0.70), <strong>13% improvement</strong> over top NFL helmets at the time</li>
      <li>Created one of the world's first fully <strong>3D-printed cycling helmets</strong>, recognized by HP and Sculpteo as breakthrough in helmet design</li>
      <li>Won inaugural <strong>Simulation Driven Design Award</strong> at Formnext 2019 (Purmundus Challenge) for KUPOL R1-0 motorcycle helmet</li>
    </ul>
